Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the best_single CWT_catboost from pool2 to see if adding ONLY_CWT_catboost improves the single best score.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","pool":"pool2","model":"CWT_catboost","rationale":"add ONLY_CWT_catboost to pool2 to see if single best improves"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing pooled_meta_model handle w1 on pool3 to see if it improves over best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

